ing and domestic purposes in Pakistan.", "conf": 0.925, "box": [[66, 1010], [742, 1004], [743, 1030], [66, 1037]]}, {"text": "There are several types of coal, but Anthracite and Bituminous are of good quality. Anthracite is", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[65, 1044], [836, 1037], [836, 1065], [65, 1071]]}, {"text": "used in Iron and Steel factories to melt metals whereas Bituminousis used for making'roads and", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[63, 1071], [836, 1064], [836, 1090], [63, 1097]]}, {"text": "togenerateelectricity.", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[64, 1101], [251, 1101], [251, 1121], [64, 1121]]}, {"text": "Unit6:MineralsandPowerResources", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[58, 1153], [301, 1154], [301, 1174], [58, 1173]]}, {"text": "77", "conf": 0.505, "box": [[436, 1157], [459, 1157], [459, 1178], [436, 1178]]}]}